    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tincho the capybara has just discovered there's more to eat than grass.</strong> In this 2D platformer adventure, Tincho travels across different regions of Argentina to explore its cuisine and help prepare traditional dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore levels inspired by real-life landscapes, search for the right ingredients, and team up with native animals like Wadu the penguin, the caiman, and the coati. Each one has a role in the kitchen: chopping, mixing, or cooking. If you do everything in the right order, you'll complete the dish and move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This short game includes two playable characters and sample levels to try out the minigames, humor, and educational style of the game. Perfect for platformer fans looking for a cultural twist.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tincho the capybara has just discovered there's more to eat than grass.</strong> In this 2D platformer adventure, Tincho travels across different regions of Argentina to explore its cuisine and help prepare traditional dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore levels inspired by real-life landscapes, search for the right ingredients, and team up with native animals like Wadu the penguin, the caiman, and the coati. Each one has a role in the kitchen: chopping, mixing, or cooking. If you do everything in the right order, you'll complete the dish and move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This short game includes two playable characters and sample levels to try out the minigames, humor, and educational style of the game. Perfect for platformer fans looking for a cultural twist.</p>",
    "short_description": "A 2.5D platformer where you explore Argentine cuisine by collecting ingredients and completing recipes with the help of native animals.",
